<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '44px 56px 24px 56px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#061F32', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>研发投入加码：2026H1半年投入接近2025全年，补齐"大脑"短板</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#061F32', marginTop: 12 }} />
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', flex: 1, gap: 32, alignItems: 'stretch', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: '30%', background: '#061F32', padding: '28px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 72, color: '#08A6F6', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>+152%</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>2026H1研发费用同比增速，半年投入1.36亿元已接近2025全年（1.45亿元）</Text>
            <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#44546A' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#99BDED', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>投向：具身智能大模型、运动控制算法、本体与结构研发；2025年前三季度云算力租赁费835万元，为2024全年的近8倍。</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
            <Chart
                style={{ height: 380 }}
                chartType='barChart'
                title='研发费用（万元）'
                titleColor='#061F32'
                showLegend={false}
                showDataLabels={true}
                dataLabelColor='#061F32'
                axisColor='#808080'
                colors={['#001965']}
                background='#FFFFFF'
                data={[
                    ['报告期', '研发费用'],
                    ['2023', 4995],
                    ['2024*', 6983],
                    ['2025', 14497],
                    ['2026H1', 13591],
                ]}
            />
            <Box style={{ background: '#F5F5F5', padding: '14px 20px', borderLeft: '3px solid #08A6F6' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#061F32', lineHeight: 1.5, fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>2025年研发费用率8.53%，低于优必选（&gt;25%）与科创板中位数（12.5%）——<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>强项在"小脑"（本体/电机/运控），"大脑"（具身大模型）需要补课</span>；IPO募投约36亿元投向三个研发项目提供资金保障。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#808080', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>来源：招股说明书、上市公告书；*2024年研发费用为按17.8%费用率的推算值；可比公司数据为证券时报转引</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#808080', fontFamily: 'Arial, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif' }}>12</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
